    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862860/extras/2fd7f6be31345cd6ba65fb56ef423420.avif?t=1752645351\" width=616 height=205 /></span>Adventures of Willy Dickhard is a fully animated, old-school point-and-click adventure inspired by the golden era of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple, classic gameplay mechanics, players will explore a world filled with puzzles, humor, and over 50 unique female characters to meet and interact with. The game offers around 40 hours of content, featuring numerous optional locations, hidden secrets, and a rich collectible system for players who love to dig deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the laughs, the puzzles, or the (ahem) adventures \u2014 Willy\u2019s journey is as absurd as it is unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862860/extras/006c3c1b300efe516e0cc5ab9dc1ff6f.avif?t=1752645351\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Willy Dickhard is just an average guy \u2014 average job, average life, average wife... but with a truly above-average mustache.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, he discovers he has an unexpected talent: the irresistible ability to seduce super sexy women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to make the most of this newfound gift, Willy sets out on a wild quest to charm every stunning girl he meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His adventure takes him across the chaotic streets of Duck City \u2014 and far beyond.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862860/extras/2fd7f6be31345cd6ba65fb56ef423420.avif?t=1752645351\" width=616 height=205 /></span>Adventures of Willy Dickhard is a fully animated, old-school point-and-click adventure inspired by the golden era of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple, classic gameplay mechanics, players will explore a world filled with puzzles, humor, and over 50 unique female characters to meet and interact with. The game offers around 40 hours of content, featuring numerous optional locations, hidden secrets, and a rich collectible system for players who love to dig deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for the laughs, the puzzles, or the (ahem) adventures \u2014 Willy\u2019s journey is as absurd as it is unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862860/extras/006c3c1b300efe516e0cc5ab9dc1ff6f.avif?t=1752645351\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Willy Dickhard is just an average guy \u2014 average job, average life, average wife... but with a truly above-average mustache.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, he discovers he has an unexpected talent: the irresistible ability to seduce super sexy women.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to make the most of this newfound gift, Willy sets out on a wild quest to charm every stunning girl he meets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His adventure takes him across the chaotic streets of Duck City \u2014 and far beyond.</p>",
